Challenge D — Costmap Exploration (Results Summary)
============================================================

Run | inflation_radius | cost_scaling | Wall proximity | Tight space behaviour | Path detour | Success | Notes
----+------------------+--------------+----------------+-----------------------+-------------+---------+-----------------------------------------------
1   | 0.30             | 3.0          | Very close     | Navigates through     | Direct      |   Y     | Robot drives very close to walls.
2   | 0.55 (base)      | 3.0          | Safe           | Navigates through     | Moderate    |   Y     | Balanced clearance and smooth navigation.
3   | 0.80             | 3.0          | Very safe      | Hesitates             | Significant |   Y     | Large clearance, avoids walls and takes longer paths.


Costmap Visualisation Observations
----------------------------------
- Small inflation (0.30): Narrow inflated regions with sharp cost gradients close to obstacles.
- Baseline inflation (0.55): Clearly defined obstacle borders with smooth gradient transitions.
- Large inflation (0.80): Wide inflated regions significantly reducing free space.

